// Hostile inputs against the results-package contract. Cases are generated by
// tests/case-package/hostile/cases.ts (synthetic, deterministic); this file asserts the outcome
// under the contract: verdict, no candidate on reject, the specific diagnostic codes, the
// recorded original mapping, safe rendering, and that nothing is written to the case folder.
